\section{The data directories}

The todo and tracking directories mirror [[get_todo_dir]]
(\cref{cli.todo}) and [[get_tracking_storage]]
(\cref{cli.track}): the configuration keys, the defaults under
[[~/.nytid]] and the read-only semantics are all the same, as
discussed in \cref{prompt:config}.
The two implementations differ only in how they reach the file---we
parse the JSON ourselves to avoid the import cost, they go through
